  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Personalbidrag till Europeiska utrikestj&#xe4;nsten (EEAS), Human Rights 1, Global Division</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Secondment of personnel to the European External Action Service</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Domstolsverket tillhandah&#xe5;ller personal som tj&#xe4;nstg&#xf6;r vid den Europeiska utrikestj&#xe4;nsten (EEAS)</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Swedish National Courts Administration (SNCA) has been assigned by the government to recruit and make personnel available for missions within the framework EU Common Security and Defence Policy (CSDP), and also to strive to second personnel to the international organisations&#x2019; headquarters. The SNCA has seconded a national expert for a period of two years to the EEAS in Brussels who works in with human rights issues within CSDP missions.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Domstolsverkets uts&#xe4;nde till EU:s utrikestj&#xe4;nst EEAS (European External Action Service) ska bidra med att utveckla EU:s arbete med m&#xe4;nskliga r&#xe4;ttigheter.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The seconded personnel to the European External Action Service (EEAS) will contribute to the development of the EU&apos;s work on human rights.</narrative>
  </description>
